  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "#Array Methods\r\n\r\n1.  **Run and Observe** Use the pop, push, shift, and unshift buttons to see how they affect the playlist\r\n\r\n2.  **Ask the AI (Code Explainer)**\r\n    * Highlight the line `songs.push(s)` inside the `addRequest` function.\r\n    * Right-click and select **\"Add to AI Tutor Chat\"**.\r\n    * Type: *\"Explain what this function does. How does it affect the array?\"*\r\n    * Read the explanation. Then, do the same for `.unshift()`, `.pop()`, and `.shift()`.\r\n\r\n3.  **Tinker and Test**\r\n    * Find the `vipBump` function in your code.\r\n    * Change the code so it always adds your favorite song (e.g., `songs.unshift(\"My Fav Song\")`) instead of using the input value `s`.\r\n    * Run the code again and click **VIP Bump** to test your change.",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
